{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c0eefac9e376b743426cf1a3e1657987.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Turquoise, a 3D sandbox game that immerses you in the heart of a protected marine zone. In this peaceful space, you\u2019re free to imagine, decorate, and shape an environment that nurtures underwater life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.poster.avif?t=1752252995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.webm?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.mp4?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c078dbf3e1b1a248ebfb1059d8e85fd2.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design the seabed using a freeform decoration editor place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to craft a harmonious environment. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last. Collect, observe, and learn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.poster.avif?t=1752252995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.webm?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.mp4?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you discover new fish and underwater creatures, you unlock entries in an integrated in-game wiki, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins. A peaceful, educational, and inspiring experience. Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f6bccf7f4f6291c86b468231f3eaf4f3.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A freely modifiable 3D ocean zone,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive decoration editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collection of fish and marine creatures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Integrated wiki to learn more about discovered fauna,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, contemplative atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe the wildlife thrive in the environment you created</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take care of your slice of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800420?t=1752252995","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/7c28fc48208225ef9b1611cf006ffe51ea3a5712/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752252995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/ba0eaafad73005e8b1b95a9a9940d6dcda92aea3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752252995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/ba0eaafad73005e8b1b95a9a9940d6dcda92aea3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752252995","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c0eefac9e376b743426cf1a3e1657987.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Turquoise, a 3D sandbox game that immerses you in the heart of a protected marine zone. In this peaceful space, you\u2019re free to imagine, decorate, and shape an environment that nurtures underwater life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.poster.avif?t=1752252995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.webm?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/6567bf53ba4f4efa720256167e52168a.mp4?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c078dbf3e1b1a248ebfb1059d8e85fd2.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design the seabed using a freeform decoration editor place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to craft a harmonious environment. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last. Collect, observe, and learn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.poster.avif?t=1752252995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.webm?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/341fc987b315397cde0b120b68103f5d.mp4?t=1752252995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you discover new fish and underwater creatures, you unlock entries in an integrated in-game wiki, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins. A peaceful, educational, and inspiring experience. Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f6bccf7f4f6291c86b468231f3eaf4f3.avif?t=1752252995\" /></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A freely modifiable 3D ocean zone,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive decoration editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collection of fish and marine creatures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Integrated wiki to learn more about discovered fauna,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, contemplative atmosphere,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe the wildlife thrive in the environment you created</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take care of your slice of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold.</p>","developers":["Low Flame Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_